  "description": "Fuaran op-stream branching-DAG abstractions (opt-in, rung-4). The DAG is Fuaran.Core's: a DagOpRecord is a Core DagNode over the linear chain's provenance envelope (StreamEntry), addressed by Core's Dag.nodeId under the tier's SHA-256, verified by Core's Dag.firstBreak. The IDagOpStreamSink superset interface (atomic tryAdvanceHead CAS, admission by address recompute and parent presence, a pruned-node skeleton beside the live set), the verified lift from a linear segment, and the canonical record wire form. The linear OpRecord / IOpStreamSink are untouched. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
